ESPKit is an independent implementation of the Espressif serial bootloader
protocol. It contains no code from esptool, espefuse or espsecure
(GPL-2.0-or-later). Protocol constants, register addresses and timing values
are technical facts documented by Espressif.

Third-party components:

- esp-flasher-stub v2.0.0 (https://github.com/espressif/esp-flasher-stub)
  Copyright (c) 2025 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
  Flasher stub binaries, dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. The release JSON
  files are embedded verbatim in Sources/ESPDevice/BundledStubs.swift,
  generated by Tools/generate-stubs.py.

Third-party components added in later phases:

- ESP-IDF eFuse tables (components/efuse/<chip>/esp_efuse_table.csv)
  Apache-2.0. Used as input of Tools/efuse-codegen; generated Swift sources
  are derived works of these tables.
